  "title": "Slow Cooker Chicken Enchilada Soup",
  "description": "Pale ale adds great flavor to this hearty chicken soup made with enchilada sauce, black beans, and fresh cilantro in the slow cooker.",
  "authors": [
    "Sabbath Jackson"
  ],
